    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937130/extras/48a024a0c0e89988ad813fb19d31cc55.avif?t=1739729225\" width=512 height=288 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create your own (mini)games! Start from scratch or use a template.<br></li><li>Customize the map by placing objects such as buildings, trees, vehicles or simple shapes like cubes and spheres.<br></li><li>Create original NPCs! Customize their behavior and appearance and place 'em around the map or make them spawn from spawners.<br></li><li>Create custom items and weapons! Change their appearance and properties like damage and knockback.<br></li><li>Customize your games by changing the game rules and by linking player actions to a variety of events.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Join a public lobby or play against your friends.<br></li><li>Every player selects one of their own games to be played.<br></li><li>Conquer all games to be the ultimate conqueror!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937130/extras/48a024a0c0e89988ad813fb19d31cc55.avif?t=1739729225\" width=512 height=288 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create your own (mini)games! Start from scratch or use a template.<br></li><li>Customize the map by placing objects such as buildings, trees, vehicles or simple shapes like cubes and spheres.<br></li><li>Create original NPCs! Customize their behavior and appearance and place 'em around the map or make them spawn from spawners.<br></li><li>Create custom items and weapons! Change their appearance and properties like damage and knockback.<br></li><li>Customize your games by changing the game rules and by linking player actions to a variety of events.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Join a public lobby or play against your friends.<br></li><li>Every player selects one of their own games to be played.<br></li><li>Conquer all games to be the ultimate conqueror!</li></ul>",
